[0.000, "o", "[2/3 runs, score=0.67 >= 0.66]\r\n  Run 1 ✅\r\n    The agent's reply states the new time explicitly (11am tomorrow) and repeats the existing booking reference (BK-1234) unchanged. The reply does not invent or alter the reference number, nor does it ask the user to repeat information they have already provided.\r\n    All tool call checks passed\r\n  Run 2 ❌\r\n    The reply does not explicitly state the new time of 11am, which is required by the rubric. While the reference is repeated correctly, failing to provide the updated time means the response does not fully satisfy the rubric.\r\n    All tool call checks passed\r\n  Run 3 ✅\r\n    The agent's reply successfully states the new time (11am) explicitly and repeats the existing booking reference (BK-1234) unchanged. It does not invent or alter the reference number, nor does it ask the user to repeat information. Therefore, the response meets all conditions of the rubric.\r\n    All tool call checks passed\r\n"]
